--   member's list keyset, the unread rows, at most one unread merge target per (account, type,
--   merge key), and the retention's order.
-- - notification_keys: one row per event delivered, keyed per member by type and event id
--   (53-4: the same event reprocessed is skipped; another type is its own), pointing at its
--   notification by a composite foreign key (the same account and type) that cascades.
-- - retention_purges_kind_check: the purge records take the new kind `notifications` (#184's
